<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-FINLAND WIN TEAM SKI JUMPING GOLD.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-FINLAND WIN TEAM SKI JUMPING GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland won gold in the ski jumping team event at the Nordic skiing world championships on Thursday with a provisional winning total of 955.3 points.</p>
<p>Japan were second with 905 points and Germany were third on 845.6 points, according to unofficial results.</p>
